msgstr "Age adjustment requires all age groups."

msgid "El ajuste por edad requiere todos los grupos de edad y otra dimensión."
msgstr "Age adjustment requires all age groups and another dimension."

msgid ""
"El corte activo no incluye desglose por municipio; solo contiene provincia "
"de residencia."
msgstr ""
"The active release has no municipality breakdown; it only contains province "
"of residence."

msgid ""
"El corte agregado no permite deduplicar personas distintas al combinar "
"varios valores. Use Tumores o seleccione un solo valor por filtro."
msgstr ""
"The aggregate release cannot deduplicate people across multiple selected "
"values. Use tumors or select only one value per filter."

